title: EasyCAM5000
message: >-
  If you use this software for your project, please cite it using the metadata from this file.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Ricardo
    family-names: Marques
    alias: Eltryus
repository-code: 'https://github.com/RicardoJCMarques/EasyCAM5000'
url: 'https://cam.eltryus.design'
abstract: >-
  A suite of open-source, browser-based CAM tools for makers, running entirely client-side. EasyTrace5000 converts PCB fabrication Gerber files into isolation milling G-code or laser output; EasyShape5000 covers 2.5D and 3D CNC routing from SVG vector and STL mesh sources, including 4th-axis work.
keywords:
  - CAM
  - CNC-router
  - Laser
  - PCB
  - G-code
  - Gerber
  - Excellon
  - Isolation-routing
  - V-carve
  - 3D Relief
  - 4th Axis
